    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> 6 charges (1d6+1 at dawn). Magic action: <strong>First Command Word</strong> (1 charge) - one creature within 60 ft makes a DC 15 CON save or is Incapacitated for 1 minute (repeat save at the end of each of its turns); <strong>Second</strong> (3 charges) - the same in a 30-ft Cone; <strong>Third</strong> (5 charges) - cast Cloudkill (DC 17). On the last charge, roll 1d20: on a 1 it's lost (by hand).</p>",
